on,\n  receipt_verify_url: carry.receipt_jws ? 'https://metrecept.co.uk/verify#' + String(carry.receipt_jws).trim() : null,\n  session: session,\n  session_receipt_verify_url: session_receipt_verify_url\n} }];\n"
